OL,3,ANoel Gallagher guitar sells for #12,000
OL,4,Aat auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FA guitar which originally belonged to
OL,7,FNoel Gallagher has been sold for
OL,8,F#12,000 at auction.
OL,10,FThe limited edition Epiphone instrument
OL,11,Fin Manchester City blue was one of a
OL,12,Fnumber of items put up for sale by the
OL,13,Fson of Huw Richards, a former
OL,14,Ffront-of-house sound engineer with the
OL,15,Fband.
OL,17,FAnother of the items in his collection,
OL,18,Fa Kangol rain jacket produced for the
OL,19,Fband's touring personnel, sold for
OL,20,F#2,000.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
