OL,3,ANoel Gallagher guitar sells for #12,000
OL,4,Aat auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut a set of unheard Oasis recordings
OL,7,Fvalued at between #1.2m and #1.6m were
OL,8,Fpulled from the auction last week,
OL,9,Fafter the band filed an injunction.
